This is a map of all campgrounds I visited and plan to go to. If they are already on my blog, there is a link on the map to the right page.

[googlemaps https://www.google.com/maps/d/u/1/embed?mid=19z-i_9Fd1JovAFocbJk2YGl9aAQ&amp;w=640&amp;h=480]

Having privacy and space ot Campground neighbors is very important to me. My Campground ratings are based on privacy and noise level.

[gallery ids="713,712,714,715" columns="4"]

&nbsp;

green: beautiful campground, private sites

blue: great campground, camp neibors are closer

orange: campground is ok, might be close to a noisy street or RV's

red: I would not go again, too crowed and noisy, no privacy

